What was changed: each WHO xlsx file was converted to CSV by scripts/growth/convert.py. Only the age
(Day or Month), L, M and S columns were kept; the SD columns were dropped. Every kept value is the same
number as in the source cell, written as the shortest decimal that reads back as that cell's value (the
value Excel shows); nothing was rounded or recomputed. Each CSV starts with comment lines naming its
source file, URL and SHA-256.

